WEBVTT

00:00:58.262 --> 00:01:00.556
because I was crying like a baby.

00:01:00.598 --> 00:01:02.016
(Laughter)

00:01:02.058 --> 00:01:03.601
You know, around the world,

00:01:03.643 --> 00:01:07.313
less than seven percent of people
own a bachelor’s degree.

00:01:07.939 --> 00:01:11.609
But there are many
who would like to go to university.

00:01:12.401 --> 00:01:14.987
But for them, much like my father,

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:19.784
the barriers to getting into
and graduating from college

00:01:19.784 --> 00:01:20.993
are just too high.

00:01:21.869 --> 00:01:24.080
It simply costs too much.

00:01:24.831 --> 00:01:28.501
And that cost is often
the price of tuition.

00:01:29.752 --> 00:01:33.548
In the United States,
a four-year bachelor's degree